		{
			dependencies: ["1009AE6C6D8D0887"]
			description: ["The &6Mirror Shell&r can now tap &6Kerr Condensate&r from the still cloud around the hole, with a wave packet to seed it and the lock kept as catalyst. The shell at Sagittarius A*, and a Kugelblitz forge sending packets. Every horizon-bound material. Packets come in by belt, and the lock never leaves the shell."]
