		{
			dependencies: ["357A817798DE0B18"]
			description: ["The &6stellar lift&r draws plasma from R136's very massive stars; a filter and a former turn it into confined core plasma. A nozzle coil for the lift, and a platform here: the plasma stays where it is made. Nickel-56, and the platform's first power. The wind never stops, so the lift never starves."]
