		{
			dependencies: ["161B334AA960BA09"]
			description: ["The &6pair-instability crucible&r burns the core plasma into nickel-56 slugs and ash from the star's heavier half. A liner for the crucible, and confined plasma in bulk. The nickel-56 cask, and the burner that eats it. The ash goes home to the older lines. Do not let it pile up."]
