		{
			dependencies: ["1A7ECED9F7530435"]
			description: ["Deuterium from the first minutes of the universe, left in the Stream's gas. The works sweeps it up, a tower fractionates it and a calutron picks the heavy half. The gas works here, then the cryogenic plant and the calutron. The fusion torus, and the next stage's isotopes. The gas never runs out. The calutron sets the pace."]
