			dependencies: ["1A7ECED9F7530435"]
			description: ["Helium-3 from the same gas. The superfluid plant lets helium-4 flow through its leak and keeps the lighter isotope behind. The plant at home, and a calutron to finish. The fusion torus, with the deuterium. Send the helium-4 back out; the condensate side wants it."]
